---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use | GovLink" pathname="/terms">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mobile:py-12">
    <h1 class="type-site-hero text-center mb-8">Terms of Use</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
      <p class="text-secondary text-sm mb-8">Last updated: November 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By using GovLink, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Service Description</h2>
      <p>GovLink helps you find answers from official U.S. government sources. We're not a government agency — we're a tool to help you navigate government information.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">No Legal Advice</h2>
      <p><strong>GovLink does not provide legal, medical, financial, or professional advice.</strong> Information is for general educational purposes only. For decisions affecting your rights, benefits, or obligations, consult the relevant agency directly or a qualified professional.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Accuracy</h2>
      <p>We strive for accuracy by citing official .gov sources. However, government information changes. Always verify critical information on the official agency website linked in each answer.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Your Responsibilities</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Don't use GovLink for illegal activities</li>
        <li>Don't attempt to scrape, overload, or disrupt the service</li>
        <li>Don't submit personal identifiers (SSN, passwords, etc.) in questions</li>
        <li>Respect rate limits and API policies of underlying government services</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Government API Terms</h2>
      <p>GovLink uses official government APIs. Your use is subject to their terms, which may include rate limits, attribution requirements, and usage restrictions.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">No Warranty</h2>
      <p>GovLink is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We don't guarantee uninterrupted, error-free, or complete service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, GovLink and its operators aren't liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages from your use of the service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms. Continued use after changes means you accept them.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by U.S. federal law and the laws of the District of Columbia.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Contact <a href="mailto:legal@govlink.example" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">legal@govlink.example</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>